WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.000
CommonRate explores conditional group payments for a fixed-fee expert session.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Ten seats share a 600 USDC fee. Sponsor support lowers each seat’s cost to 45 USDC.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Advancing the simulated deadline enables settlement. No money moves here.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Settlement records a simulated refund credit. Claiming is a separate action.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:44.000
The receipt shows the original deposit, final cost and remaining credit together.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:53.000
In this failed-round example, two seats’ full 120 USDC deposit becomes claimable.

00:00:53.000 --> 00:01:02.000
The experimental Live screen is separate, unaudited and not a production checkout.

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:12.000
This walkthrough demonstrates the UI, not an onchain deployment or transaction.
